# The MIDI the transport sends (RefTool midi, tests/equiv/README.md "The MIDI reference"): the full ensemble on its
# own seed, 64 bars in windows of 240 ticks, two transpositions on bar lines (bars 8 and 16, over the template's own
# schedule), bedPluck2 muted from bar 8 to bar 12, the pad from bar 16 on and the drone (not in this template) from
# about bar 31; Ambient drift loaded in bar 46: it takes over on bar 47's line, its channels its own, the mutes
# cleared (its drone sounds), the full ensemble's last offs still sent; its drone muted again from bar 56. tests/scenarios/play_midi.bln plays it on the app (selfscript) and compares what went
# out with midi_full.midiref.
template full
seed 0x93B12C05
window 240
bars 64
at 30720 transpose 3
at 61440 transpose 5
at 180000 load ambient 0x0A3B11ED
mute bedPluck2 30720 1
mute bedPluck2 46080 0
mute pad 61440 1
mute drone 120000 1
mute drone 215040 1
